# BE-34.2: the image gets the locked dependencies, app/ and alembic.ini only. Never a local
# .env (secrets come from the environment at run time, D-50 §2), a venv, caches or tests.
.env
.env.*
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
app/tests
samples
openapi.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
